WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
If you encounter something you can't handle, just call me.

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,080
Those who encounter trouble are immediately locked up.

3
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:04,080
Wait until I come back to deal with it

4
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:05,320
Good match for the host

5
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:07,080
Bear will work hard

6
00:00:11,750 --> 00:00:12,750
Don't worry, boss

7
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:18,140
I will also help look after the boss of the hotel.

8
00:00:18,140 --> 00:00:19,420
More and more losses

9
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:25,040
There are two or three missing inside. Damn it.

10
00:00:25,040 --> 00:00:26,960
This thing tastes terrible even after eating it hundreds of times

11
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:28,160
Some of them are good to eat.

12
00:00:28,160 --> 00:00:29,440
Pick three minus four

13
00:00:29,440 --> 00:00:31,520
Do you think you are still the eldest young master of the Gao family?

14
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:34,880
Mr. Gao Fei, go away and be careful to curse you to death.

15
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:36,850
Rookies will lose their price

16
00:00:36,850 --> 00:00:39,050
Every time I say I can't do it, I ask whether this trick is finished or not.

17
00:00:39,050 --> 00:00:40,050
it's a fact

18
00:00:40,050 --> 00:00:42,050
If you don't accept it, come and join the family and stop arguing.

19
00:00:43,180 --> 00:00:44,340
look over there

20
00:00:44,340 --> 00:00:45,380
Boss, what did you see?

21
00:00:45,860 --> 00:00:51,430
true or false

22
00:00:51,430 --> 00:00:52,790
Is the loss more strictly controlled?
